      ],
      "DOI": "https://doi.org/10.5536/kjps.2023.50.3.171",
      "Pubyear": 2023,
      "Pubdate": "20230930",
      "JournalName": "한국가금학회지 = Korean journal of poultry science",
      "Author": [
        "지운학",
