        "1225-0171",
        "2287-545x"
      ],
      "DOI": "https://doi.org/10.5656/ksae.2023.08.0.022",
      "Pubyear": 2023,
      "Pubdate": "20231201",
      "JournalName": "한국응용곤충학회지 = Korean journal of applied entomology",
      "Author": [
