        "supercritical fluid extraction method",
        "anti-microbial",
        "anti-biofilm",
        "anti-inflammation"
      ],
      "keyword2_raw": "Perillae Semen . Supercritical Fluid Extraction Method . Anti-microbial . Anti-biofilm . Anti-inflammation",
