          "author": "Ha, J.-M., Hwang, K.-R., Kim, Y.-M., Jae, J., Kim, K. H., Lee, H. W., Kim, J.-Y., and Park, Y.-K.",
          "journal": "Renew. Sust. Energ. Rev.",
