      "CN": "JAKO202107356008098",
      "DBCode": "JAKO",
      "Title": "1,3-부타디엔과 부텐 올리고머 공동 생산을 위한 바이오 정유 공정의 설계 및 분석",
      "Title2": "Process Development and Analysis of Diorefinery for the Coproduction of 1,3-Butadiene and Butene Oligomer",
      "Abstract": "Environmental issues caused by our dependence on fossil fuels have caused our society to move toward new renewable sources of energy and chemicals. In this study, we develop an integrated process that co-produces butene oligomer (i.e., biofuels) and 1,3-butadiene (i.e., monomer for the production of synthetic rubber). To minimize utility consumption, we conduct heat integration. Then, we conduct a range of techno-economic analysis and life-cycle assessment to investigate economic and environmental feasibility of the proposed process.",
