      ],
      "DOI": "https://doi.org/10.9798/kosham.2020.20.4.231",
      "Pubyear": 2020,
      "Pubdate": "20200831",
      "JournalName": "한국방재학회논문집 = Journal of the Korean Society of Hazard Mitigation",
      "Author": [
        "신재용",
