    {
      "CN": "JAKO201813649331278",
      "DBCode": "JAKO",
      "Title": "교량 유지관리용 디지털 트윈 모델 구축을 위한 수치해석모델 개선 기법",
      "Title2": "Numerical Model Updating for Bridge Maintenance Using Digital-Twin Model",
      "Abstract": "As the number of aged bridges increases, the development of efficient bridge maintenance techniques is becoming more important. Particularly, there have been many studies on digital-twin models of bridges for maintenance and SHM (Structure Health Monitering). However, in order to use the digital-twin model for maintenance of the bridge, the model updating process that matches the structural response between the real bridge and the digital-twin bridge model must be done. This study presents a model updating method that adjusts bridge's stiffness and boundary condition with genetic algorithm (GA) using static displacements and verified proposed updating method through field test on PSC girder bridge. This study also proposes a conceptual idea to construct an efficient bridge maintenance system by applying the updated numerical analysis model to the digital-twin model.",
      "Abstract2": null,
      "Keyword": [
        "디지털 트윈",
        "유지관리",
        "PSC 거더교",
        "유전자알고리즘",
        "모델개선"
      ],
      "keyword_raw": "디지털 트윈 . 유지관리 . PSC 거더교 . 유전자알고리즘 . 모델개선",
      "Keyword2": [
        "digital-twin",
        "bridge maintenance",
        "psc girder bridge",
        "genetic algorithm",
        "model updating"
      ],
      "keyword2_raw": "Digital-Twin . Bridge maintenance . PSC girder bridge . Genetic algorithm . Model updating",
