    {
      "CN": "DIKO0017305559",
      "DBCode": "DIKO",
      "Title": "프로바이오틱스의 장 전달을 위한 pH-감응성 CNF/젤라틴 복합 하이드로겔",
      "Title2": "pH-Sensitive CNF/Gelatin Composite Hydrogels for Intestinal Delivery of Probiotics",
      "Abstract": "Oral administration of probiotics offers a promising approach for managing intestinal health and gut-related disorders. However, maintaining their viability through harsh gastric&#xD; environments remains a significant challenge in ensuring effective delivery to the intestine. In this study, we developed cellulose nanofiber/gelatin (CNFG) composite hydrogels for&#xD; probiotic release. Characterization of hydrogel was done by SEM, TEM, FTIR, zeta potential, and turbidity test confirmed the hydrogel’s structural integrity and electrostatic&#xD; stability. Internal pH analysis with bromophenol blue indicated that gelatin contributed to maintaining an acidic microenvironment, thereby protecting encapsulated probiotics. Under simulated gastric conditions, the CNFG hydrogel-maintained Lactobacillus rhamnosus GG(LGG) viability (≥ 9.16 log CFU/ml), whereas hydrogels without gelatin failed to offer protection. Upon exposure to intestinal pH, the hydrogel disintegrated, enabling the complete release of LGG. These findings suggest that CNFG composite hydrogel is a&#xD; promising oral platform for the pH-modulated intestinal delivery of probiotics.",
      "Abstract2": null,
