        "1008-9292"
      ],
      "DOI": "https://doi.org/10.3724/zdxbyxb-2024-0150",
      "Pubyear": 2025,
      "Pubdate": "20250125",
      "JournalName": "浙江大學學報. Journal of Zhejiang University. Medical sciences. 醫學版",
      "Author": [
