        "1672-7347"
      ],
      "DOI": "https://doi.org/10.11817/j.issn.1672-7347.2024.230581",
      "Pubyear": 2024,
      "Pubdate": "20240828",
      "JournalName": "中南大學學報. Journal of Central South University. 醫學版",
      "Author": [
        "HOUDan",
